hout measurement.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-052\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"a burst is cheaper to smooth than it is to serve at its peak.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this directly.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-053\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A caller that can move half its work to a quieter hour usually gets what it needs without any change to the cap at all,\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text uses equivalent wording.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-054\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel,\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this explicitly.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-055\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"and they are answered within two working days.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text directly states the response time.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-056\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"There is no expedited path\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this exactly.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-057\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"and no exception list.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly states this.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-001\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Every credential has a cap.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The singular 'a cap' per credential necessarily implies 'of its own.'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-002\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"When that cap is spent the gateway answers 429 at the edge — without waking the service behind it —\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"'Without troubling' and 'without waking' convey the same meaning.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Requests are counted against the credential that presented them, over a fixed window of 60 seconds, never against a connection.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text explicitly contrasts credential with connection counting.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"over a fixed window of 60 seconds,\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text directly states the window duration.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text does not discuss whether the gateway discloses the window start.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text mentions multiple processes but does not explicitly state the count follows across hosts.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-007\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"a client spread across multiple worker processes is throttled at exactly the point a single process would have been.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"'Many processes' and 'multiple processes' convey the same meaning.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-008\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The default allowance is 100 requests in a window.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n     